   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-08-03T23:20:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-Enemies with pistols can shoot though walls, fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-The female pianist has a male voice, fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Upgrading broadsides for more guns and damage proves to be detrimental, because enemy ships always sink before they can be boarded, fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-When boarding, your crew can get stuck on the side of your ship, and stays there after boarding, fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Ammunition has the picture of modern assault rifle-bullets, changed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Sharks are turned off, but they're still there, fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-You can upgrade ranged damage of your crew, but they never use guns, fixed. (Turned into crew health power)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-All achievements are now unlockable and I've added a system to check for missing achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
